            "title": "Recommended actions (from action codes)\n\n• C-M2.2 — Mix Optimization (Margin-Driven)\n  Owner: category_manager\n  Trigger: sales.pvm.mix_effect.amount < -75000\n  Impact: Medium, DirectMarginImprovement\n  Expected: 0.3–1.2 pp\n  Confidence: Medium\n  · IDENTIFY each {entity} with persistent negative mix effect\n  · RANK SKUs by margin contribution for this {entity}\n  · ADJUST sales targets and focus lists for this {entity}\n  ⚠ Trigger only if price realization is within guardrails\n  ⚠ Do not trigger if negative mix is driven by temporary availability constraints\n\n• C-P4.1 — Promo Calendar Discipline\n  Owner: trade_marketing_lead\n  Trigger: sales.promo.roi.pct < -5.0%\n  Impact: High, DirectMarginImprovement\n  Expected: 5.0–20.0 pp\n  Confidence: High\n  · IDENTIFY each {entity} with repeated negative ROI\n  · REVIEW mechanics and baseline assumptions for this {entity}\n  · STOP, REPLACE, or RESEQUENCE this {entity} based on ROI analysis\n  ⚠ Trigger only if baseline quality checks pass (baseline sales/qty present)\n  ⚠ Do not trigger if Promo Gross Margin % remains above target\n\n• C-S1.2 — Sales Gap Recovery via Price & Pack Adjustment\n  Owner: sales_director\n  Trigger: sales.net_sales.delta_pct.plan < -5.0%\n  Impact: Medium, RevenueUplift\n  Expected: 1.0–3.0 %\n  Confidence: Medium\n  · IDENTIFY each {entity} breaching plan thresholds\n  · SELECT eligible products for this {entity} within GM guardrails\n  · APPLY temporary price or pack adjustments to this {entity}\n  ⚠ Trigger only if Gross Margin % >= 25%\n  ⚠ Do not trigger if price effect is structurally negative for 3+ months (hand over to COM-002)",
